{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "section_title", "parent_tag": "050S", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\section{", "suffix": "}\n\\label{section-quasi-compact}"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7c36876e166b2872fb08335af908f98547eb8976dc5a902d1c6b4dcca0351a71", "source_text": "Quasi-compact morphisms", "source_text_hash": "sha256:71f80a3aad4a5f01f5a8b1580bd18060a5ef31c7da5287973f34c637e4844172", "unit_id": "tag:050S:title"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "050S", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{stacks-properties-section-properties-morphisms}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:dfaee67d46ddd4d888702445be4244f6d5bf5b01389aeba0ea95707e8ecf77c4", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:1c557d437d9380643e64c0738d923558ee722886d6328907cc7a46c245428adb", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks which is representable by\nalgebraic spaces. In\nProperties of Stacks, Section\n<REF_0001>\nwe have defined what it means for <MATH_0002> to be quasi-compact.\nHere is another characterization.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:184ba0ce0fdfc8ab495803b15d99bf6cf10f742dba13e08afc93b33106fc13c8", "unit_id": "tag:050S:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "050S", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{stacks-properties-section-properties-morphisms}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-characterize-representable-quasi-compact}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:8c3d7a79b7e9e504747b87059adc825d3fa52302e433411070036a87a685c708", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7ae9a0edc8837f1af61f19529f6878b0120ad9d107e2f4a1af0d63390ed662aa", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks\nwhich is representable by algebraic spaces. The following are equivalent:\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0002> is quasi-compact (as in Properties of Stacks,\nSection <REF_0001>), and\n<STRUCT_0003> for every quasi-compact algebraic stack <MATH_0003>\nand any morphism <MATH_0004> the algebraic stack\n<MATH_0005> is quasi-compact.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:6c72bd28e2b1d30807b124a93e498bb923a5c202cc52c5b3f39732a0e3ae30ed", "unit_id": "tag:050T:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "050S", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0003": "$U$", "MATH_0004": "$U \\to \\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0005": "$f$", "MATH_0006": "$U \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0007": "$U \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X} \\to U$", "MATH_0008": "$U \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0009": "$U \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X} \\to\n\\mathcal{Z} \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0010": "$U \\to \\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0011": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0012": "$Z \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0013": "$Z$", "MATH_0014": "$p : Z \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X} \\to Z$", "MATH_0015": "$U \\subset Z$", "MATH_0016": "$p^{-1}(U) = U \\times_\\mathcal{Y} Z$", "MATH_0017": "$U \\times_\\mathcal{Y} Z$", "MATH_0018": "$p$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{stacks-properties-lemma-quasi-compact-stack}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{stacks-properties-lemma-quasi-compact-stack}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{spaces-morphisms-lemma-quasi-compact-local}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\medskip", "STRUCT_0002": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:82083e134846eb473026d9ca34cd9579cef1fb3957882cbe9c597b08d0c6150e", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:d2fec2aa276b74829b7467fd8e0e335dbbefaed621f7472a2975bccdb47a2e96", "source_text": "Assume (1), and let <MATH_0001>\nbe a morphism of algebraic stacks with <MATH_0002> quasi-compact. By\nProperties of Stacks,\nLemma <REF_0001>\nthere exists a quasi-compact scheme <MATH_0003> and a surjective smooth\nmorphism <MATH_0004>. Since <MATH_0005> is representable by algebraic\nspaces and quasi-compact we see by definition that\n<MATH_0006> is an algebraic space, and that\n<MATH_0007> is quasi-compact.\nHence <MATH_0008> is a quasi-compact algebraic space.\nThe morphism\n<MATH_0009>\nis smooth and surjective (as the base change of the smooth\nand surjective morphism <MATH_0010>).\nHence <MATH_0011>\nis quasi-compact by another application of\nProperties of Stacks,\nLemma <REF_0002>\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\nAssume (2). Let <MATH_0012> be a morphism, where <MATH_0013> is a scheme.\nWe have to show that the morphism of algebraic spaces\n<MATH_0014> is quasi-compact.\nLet <MATH_0015> be affine open. Then\n<MATH_0016>\nand the algebraic space <MATH_0017>\nis quasi-compact by assumption (2). Hence <MATH_0018> is quasi-compact, see\nMorphisms of Spaces, Lemma <REF_0003>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0ba9fb7da2d087c96468a4a99dc4e6e3e1133b5d57379c4cc357ddeea4ff5351", "unit_id": "tag:050T:proof"}
